    // so it's confirm-gated and uses the same Task.Run/InvokeAsync
    // progress-reporting pattern as every other long-running button here -
    // unlike Merge/Delete above, this only ever adds or updates inventory,
    // so the confirm is about the time it takes, not about risk of losing
    // anything.
    //
